WEBVTT

NOTE Ubusemuzi bwakozwe na mudasobwa — bugomba gusuzumwa n'umunyarwanda.

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Muraho nshuti! Uyu munsi twiga uko twagira isuku n'ubuzima bwiza!

2
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:18.500
Isuku bivuze kugira umubiri n'aho tuba ari heza!

3
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:28.500
Tugomba gukaraba amaboko n'isabune n'amazi meza!

4
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:38.500
Amaboko meza atuma udupfunyi tutatugiraho ingaruka!

5
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:48.500
Tugomba koza amenyo buri munsi kugira ngo abe meza kandi akomeye!

6
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:58.500
Twisukura umubiri kandi twiyuhagira kenshi!

7
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:08.500
Isuku nziza kandi bivuze kugira aho tuba heza!

8
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.500
Karaba amaboko, oza amenyo, ugire umubiri mwiza!

9
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.500
Sukura aho uri, buri munsi, ugire ubuzima bwiza n'ibyishimo!
